@startuml Mo_RPG_Hero_Release_Sequence

title Mo RPG Hero — GitHub to Mobile Release Sequence

actor Developer
participant GitHub
participant CI as "GitHub Actions"
participant Release as "GitHub Release"
participant Host as "Android Host"
participant Client as "Joining Android Client"
participant Game as "Game Runtime"
participant DB as "Host Persistence"

Developer -> GitHub: push source change
GitHub -> CI: trigger validation/build
CI -> CI: npm install
CI -> CI: stage Android assets
CI -> CI: compile debug APK
CI -> CI: compile release APK
CI --> GitHub: artifacts + build result

Developer -> GitHub: push vX.Y.Z tag
GitHub -> CI: trigger release workflow
CI -> CI: build release APK
CI -> CI: generate release metadata
CI -> Release: publish artifact + notes + checksum

Host -> Release: check compatible version
Release --> Host: release manifest
Host -> Release: download package/content
Host -> Host: verify checksum/signature
Host -> Host: stage update
Host -> Host: apply compatible update
Host -> Game: restart/load new runtime
Game -> DB: migrate persistent state
DB --> Game: migrated state

Client -> Host: connect/join request
Host -> Client: protocol/content version
Client -> Host: compatible
Host -> Client: session state
Client -> Game: initialize synchronized state

alt incompatible client
  Host -> Client: reject + required version
else migration failure
  Game -> DB: report migration failure
  DB --> Game: rollback/retain prior state
end

@enduml
